      "behavior": "Nine native buttons inside a toolbar. Roving focus uses arrows/Home/End, skipping disabled items. Enter/Space activates by native click. Context menu and Shift+F10 emit secondary action only when supplied. Controlled selection changes only when the owner updates selectedIndex. No global keyboard or wheel listeners.",
      "limitations": [
        "Each HUD cell uses its corresponding original hotbar_0 through hotbar_8 PNG, not the container slot texture.",
        "Item artwork is caller-supplied through InventoryItem; no placeholders or drawn item replacements are generated. ItemCount and DurabilityBar reuse inventory helpers. The default durability hue and shadow remain a Web approximation of a native renderer.",
        "GUI scale is fixed at 2 for consistency with inventory overlays. World placement, native focus visuals, cooldown, lock/storage overlays and engine input mappings are outside this component."
      ]
